* New functionality

Create new function scan_invoc(s, start, can_readline_p, invoc)
to scan a string for:

["@"]  [<name>]  "{"  <stuff, including nested {...}>  "}"  ["@"]

<name> must be strict.
In <stuff>, "\{" outputs "{" but does not increment nest count.
And "\}" outputs "}" but does not end a brace block.
"\\" outputs a single "\".
If there is an open brace block currently being scanned, and if 
can_readline_p is True and the line ends with a single backslash with no
following whitespace, then readline() is called.

